---
title: Chat Sequence - User Sends Message
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant WEB as Web UI
    participant CHAT as Chat API
    participant STATE as State Store
    participant MODEL as Model Client
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant TOOLS as Tool Executor
    participant PERSIST as Artifact Persistence
    participant ARTIFACTS as Project Artifacts

    Dev->>WEB: Types message in sidebar
    WEB->>CHAT: (project_path, session_id, message) via WebSocket

    CHAT->>STATE: Load session history for (project_path, session_id)
    STATE-->>CHAT: Conversation so far

    CHAT->>MODEL: History + new message + tool declarations + project_path
    MODEL->>LLM: generate_content (HTTPS/gRPC)
    LLM-->>MODEL: Response

    alt Model returns text
        MODEL-->>CHAT: Text response
        CHAT->>STATE: Append user + model messages
        CHAT-->>WEB: Stream text only
        WEB-->>Dev: Shows text in sidebar
    else Model returns tool calls
        loop Until model returns text
            MODEL-->>TOOLS: Tool call(s) scoped to project_path
            TOOLS->>TOOLS: Execute (list_files, read_file, search_replace, etc.)
            opt Tool writes a diagram or spec
                TOOLS->>PERSIST: Save artifact
                PERSIST->>ARTIFACTS: Write to project repo
            end
            TOOLS-->>MODEL: Tool results
            MODEL->>LLM: History + tool results
            LLM-->>MODEL: Next response
        end
        MODEL-->>CHAT: Final text response
        CHAT->>STATE: Append full turn
        CHAT-->>WEB: Stream text only
        WEB-->>Dev: Shows text in sidebar
    end
